  m_Text: 'DE_DUST II  -  Bomb Defusal


    Counter-Terrorists: Prevent the Terrorists

    from planting the bomb at either bombsite.

    Eliminate the entire Terrorist team to win

    the round.


    Terrorists: Plant the bomb at bombsite A or B

    and defend it until it detonates. Eliminate

    the entire Counter-Terrorist team to win the

    round.


    Other Notes: Two bombsites (A / B). The bomb

    explodes 35 seconds after it is planted.'
